{"doc_id": "44473a6e7b5ecbf45f1792e810ea0916313be209c875e864a60fa147c0649d84", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "eligibility", "status": "present", "value_ja": null, "normalized": {"items": [{"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(1) 岡山県物品の売買、修理等及び役務の提供の契約に係る入札参加資格審査要領（平成１９年岡山県告示第３３２号。以下「審査要領」という。）第８条第２項の規定により公表されている入札参加資格を認定された事業者の名簿（以下「入札参加資格者名簿」という。）に登載されていること。", "text_en": "Must be listed on Okayama Prefecture's published registry of certified qualified bidders for goods, repairs, and services contracts.", "citations": ["p1_s23"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(2) 入札参加資格者名簿上の住所が岡山県内で、物品の売買、修理等に係る業務種目が「大分類９．その他、小分類１２．レンタル・リース類」であり、格付区分がＡであること。", "text_en": "Must have a registered address in Okayama Prefecture, business category Major 9 Other / Minor 12 Rentals & Leases, and Grade A.", "citations": ["p1_s24"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(3) 地方自治法施行令（昭和２２年政令第１６号）第１６７条の４第１項に規定する者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be a person falling under Article 167-4, Paragraph 1 of the Local Autonomy Act Enforcement Order.", "citations": ["p2_s1"]}, {"kind": "suspension", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(4) 審査要領第10条第１項の規定による入札参加の停止の措置を物品の売買、修理等に関して受けていないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under a bidding participation suspension measure for goods, repairs, etc. under Article 10(1) of the Review Guidelines.", "citations": ["p2_s2"]}, {"kind": "suspension", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(5) 岡山県物品の売買、修理等及び役務の提供の契約に係る入札参加除外等要領の規定による入札参加除外の措置を物品の売買、修理等に関して受けていないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under a bidding participation exclusion measure for goods, repairs, etc. under Okayama Prefecture's Exclusion Guidelines.", "citations": ["p2_s3"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(6) 岡山県建設工事等暴力団対策会議運営要領に基づく指名除外の措置を受けていないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under designation exclusion measures based on Okayama Prefecture's Anti-Organized-Crime Council Operating Guidelines.", "citations": ["p2_s4"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "(7) 会社更生法（平成１４年法律第１５４号）に基づく更生手続開始の申立てがなされていない者又は民事再生法（平成１１年法律第２２５号）に基づく再生手続開始の申立てがなされていない者。\nただし、更生手続開始の決定又は再生手続開始の決定を受けている者は、その申立てがなされていない者とみなす。", "text_en": "Must not be subject to a petition for commencement of corporate reorganization or civil rehabilitation proceedings (excluding those for whom a commencement order has been issued).", "citations": ["p2_s5", "p2_s6"]}]}, "value_en": "Must be listed on Okayama Prefecture's qualified bidder registry with an address in Okayama Prefecture, business category Major 9 Other / Minor 12 Rentals & Leases, and Grade A; must not fall under Article 167-4(1) of the Local Autonomy Act Enforcement Order; must not be under prefectural bidding suspension, bidding exclusion, or anti-organized-crime designation exclusion; and must not have pending corporate reorganization or civil rehabilitation petitions unless proceedings have commenced.", "citations": ["p1_s23", "p1_s24", "p2_s1", "p2_s2", "p2_s3", "p2_s4", "p2_s5", "p2_s6"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": false}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p1_s22 says all of the conditions (1) to (7) must be met. Items cite p1_s23, p1_s24, p2_s1 to p2_s4, and p2_s5 plus p2_s6 together (the ただし proviso stays inside item 7). Kinds and polarity follow the guide. B has no valid items.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
